WEBVTT

00:12.000 --> 00:14.560
♪Trapped in this tiny world♪

00:15.040 --> 00:18.440
♪I'm crushed into dust♪

00:19.200 --> 00:23.000
♪I meddle around without any mercy♪

00:23.320 --> 00:26.160
♪I'm my own pawn♪

00:26.520 --> 00:30.360
♪I sigh at my fate♪

00:30.560 --> 00:35.360
♪Numerous people are under my control♪

00:38.040 --> 00:41.880
♪All the sand is washed away♪

00:44.280 --> 00:47.880
♪An old dream fades♪

00:50.200 --> 00:54.560
♪A bumpy path lies ahead♪

00:56.040 --> 00:58.880
♪Traps within traps, I never make mistakes♪

00:59.200 --> 01:02.000
♪I take a risk at every step♪

01:02.280 --> 01:07.400
♪Even in disputes, I break through with my life♪

01:07.880 --> 01:10.280
♪Schemes within schemes, I prison myself♪

01:10.520 --> 01:13.600
♪Each link swaps bluff and truth♪

01:13.920 --> 01:16.480
♪The world is my Weiqi game board♪

01:16.800 --> 01:22.120
♪Everything's just fleeting♪

01:23.720 --> 01:28.320
♪The play begins♪

01:30.280 --> 01:32.520
♪No return is expected♪

01:32.880 --> 01:37.880
♪The flame is gone, whether we win or lose♪

01:38.280 --> 01:40.360
♪The wind never ceases. I hold the reins♪

01:40.360 --> 01:41.480
[Ashes To Crown]

01:41.480 --> 01:45.680
[Adapted from Xixing's novel, Empress of the State of Chu]

01:46.470 --> 01:49.000
[Episode 17]

01:57.540 --> 01:59.860
Amid power struggles among various forces,

02:00.180 --> 02:01.900
who would have thought

02:01.940 --> 02:03.460
that Your Highness benefited the most?

02:04.540 --> 02:06.280
Upon a sea of corpses,

02:06.280 --> 02:08.380
you rose to glory.

02:09.580 --> 02:10.660
I really wonder

02:10.660 --> 02:12.660
whether General Chu would feel relieved

02:13.540 --> 02:15.660
if he knew about it in the underworld.

02:16.060 --> 02:17.420
You don't need to bother

02:17.460 --> 02:19.020
with my father's feelings.

02:21.060 --> 02:23.540
You invited me over again after quite a few days.

02:24.020 --> 02:25.460
Will you not keep me as your guest?

02:26.860 --> 02:27.660
Originally,

02:27.940 --> 02:29.020
I wanted to ask you

02:29.100 --> 02:30.380
to stay a few more days

02:30.660 --> 02:32.140
so that I could extend my hospitality.

02:32.540 --> 02:34.940
But now, our state

02:35.020 --> 02:36.740
can't do without you.

02:37.420 --> 02:38.420
That's true.

02:39.300 --> 02:41.420
Then thank you for your hospitality.

02:42.540 --> 02:44.700
Hope I'll have another chance to visit

02:44.820 --> 02:46.580
the Prince of Xiaonan's Residence.

02:47.780 --> 02:49.420
Don't you remember, Your Highness?

02:52.820 --> 02:53.820
The court

02:54.740 --> 02:57.420
has titled me the Prince of State.

02:58.700 --> 03:00.420
I have got the Golden Seal

03:00.940 --> 03:02.780
and feudal sovereignty.

03:03.540 --> 03:05.620
So, "Prince of Xiaonan's Residence"

03:05.940 --> 03:08.500
will be "Prince of State's Residence."

03:09.340 --> 03:10.820
In this aspect,

03:11.740 --> 03:13.140
Xie Yanfang's plan

03:14.340 --> 03:16.460
coincided with yours.

03:17.500 --> 03:18.780
Interestingly enough...

03:19.100 --> 03:20.140
When Xie Yanfang

03:20.380 --> 03:21.380
was ten years old,

03:21.540 --> 03:23.900
his mastery of strategy was peerless.

03:24.300 --> 03:25.700
He deliberately lost fifty moves

03:26.100 --> 03:28.020
just for his final strike.

03:28.140 --> 03:29.460
With only a few pieces,

03:29.700 --> 03:31.180
he swept the board clean

03:31.220 --> 03:32.660
against his mentor.

03:32.900 --> 03:34.460
That wondrous tale

03:34.580 --> 03:36.660
spread far and wide across the state.

03:38.020 --> 03:38.780
Oh, General Xie.

03:39.380 --> 03:41.180
Did you not tell Her Highness?

03:41.620 --> 03:43.380
Your brother's greatest skill

03:43.700 --> 03:45.540
is to make everyone think

03:45.620 --> 03:48.220
he's the one in control of the game.

03:49.020 --> 03:50.900
It seemed like a fight between everyone.

03:51.340 --> 03:52.780
But actually, the Xie Family

03:52.820 --> 03:54.260
manipulated the game.

03:54.540 --> 03:55.860
You're quite talkative today.

03:56.100 --> 03:57.580
Do you not want me to leave?

04:00.900 --> 04:01.820
General Xie,

04:02.300 --> 04:03.980
your brother is in the Capital,

04:04.020 --> 04:04.740
and could it be...?

04:04.740 --> 04:05.620
I'm not a Xie.

04:06.860 --> 04:07.820
Nor do I have a brother.

04:09.340 --> 04:10.620
Oh, look at my poor memory.

04:10.620 --> 04:11.980
I nearly forgot.

04:13.740 --> 04:14.580
Back then,

04:14.820 --> 04:15.940
you were even

04:15.980 --> 04:17.900
excluded from the family genealogy.

04:18.180 --> 04:19.580
You two share the same father,

04:19.700 --> 04:21.820
while he wielded power in Taiji Hall,

04:21.940 --> 04:23.100
and you led a primitive life

04:23.180 --> 04:24.180
at the frontier.

04:24.220 --> 04:25.260
Totally different lives.

04:25.380 --> 04:26.660
How interesting.

04:26.740 --> 04:27.580
Mind your tongue.

04:34.100 --> 04:35.980
Don't be angry, Your Highness.

04:37.300 --> 04:38.820
I'm just curious.

04:39.020 --> 04:40.300
They're from the same family.

04:40.500 --> 04:41.860
Why did you not choose the one

04:41.900 --> 04:43.540
who could help you more?

04:44.020 --> 04:45.780
After all, without the tacit cooperation

04:45.780 --> 04:46.620
from Xie Yanfang,

04:46.740 --> 04:47.540
your schemes

04:47.540 --> 04:49.100
wouldn't have worked.

04:50.620 --> 04:51.940
That is none of your concern.

04:52.540 --> 04:53.700
I wish you

04:53.900 --> 04:55.020
good health.

04:56.380 --> 04:56.980
After all,

04:57.500 --> 04:58.620
it's not that easy

04:58.660 --> 04:59.740
to cultivate a second Xiao Xun

04:59.780 --> 05:00.660
who can meet

05:01.020 --> 05:02.140
your standards.

05:03.940 --> 05:04.460
Jiu,

05:04.940 --> 05:05.580
let's go.

05:19.100 --> 05:20.100
You're right.

05:20.980 --> 05:22.180
I'm different from Xie Yanfang.

05:23.060 --> 05:24.140
I'm more resentful than him.

05:26.100 --> 05:28.060
So, hope you and your son

05:28.740 --> 05:29.540
will never end up

05:29.580 --> 05:30.740
in my hands.

05:36.100 --> 05:36.660
Come on.

05:36.780 --> 05:37.940
See Her Highness out.

05:38.180 --> 05:38.660
Yes.

05:52.700 --> 05:53.700
Are you so sure

05:54.220 --> 05:55.500
Lord of Xiaonan won't rebel?

05:56.660 --> 05:57.660
He wouldn't dare.

05:58.660 --> 06:00.620
Not now, at least.

06:00.980 --> 06:01.900
Back in his mansion,

06:04.540 --> 06:06.260
you said Xie Yanfang would make his move.

06:07.260 --> 06:08.220
You seem

06:10.140 --> 06:11.100
to know about everyone.

06:11.780 --> 06:12.660
I don't know.

06:13.540 --> 06:14.460
I plan ahead.

06:15.220 --> 06:16.060
Like in a Weiqi game,

06:16.620 --> 06:17.420
we need to foresee

06:17.420 --> 06:19.220
the opponent's moves ten steps ahead.

06:19.860 --> 06:20.540
I simply foresee

06:20.580 --> 06:21.900
more steps ahead.

06:23.780 --> 06:24.660
He is right.

06:25.700 --> 06:26.420
What?

06:29.540 --> 06:30.460
Xie Yanfang and I

06:32.980 --> 06:33.900
are indeed different.

06:37.340 --> 06:38.180
And he can really...

06:42.860 --> 06:44.100
help you more.

06:45.380 --> 06:46.300
When I was seven,

06:46.740 --> 06:47.940
I saw him for the first time.

06:49.020 --> 06:50.540
At the top of our ancestral hall.

06:51.620 --> 06:52.380
At that time,

06:53.500 --> 06:54.260
I began to imitate

06:54.260 --> 06:55.180
every move of his.

06:56.820 --> 06:58.220
I copied his speech and behavior,

06:59.500 --> 07:00.580
hoping that one day,

07:00.860 --> 07:02.020
I could be as good as him.

07:02.820 --> 07:03.420
Even if...

07:07.540 --> 07:08.860
I could only be his shadow.

07:12.540 --> 07:13.340
Look at me.

07:16.580 --> 07:17.300
Remember.

07:18.020 --> 07:18.660
Jiu,

07:19.780 --> 07:21.460
you're no one's shadow.

07:22.700 --> 07:24.060
You don't need to be like him.

07:33.940 --> 07:35.380
But you praised him so highly.

07:38.060 --> 07:39.460
You firmly trusted

07:40.020 --> 07:41.460
every decision he made.

07:44.100 --> 07:44.660
Zhao,

07:45.420 --> 07:46.660
I know I shouldn't say this.

07:50.460 --> 07:51.780
I'm very jealous of him.

07:53.060 --> 07:53.940
I would even rather

07:55.380 --> 07:56.860
be his shadow again.

07:58.660 --> 07:59.540
Maybe then,

08:00.900 --> 08:02.420
I could help you more.

08:03.980 --> 08:04.820
Like I said,

08:05.780 --> 08:07.100
you're no one's shadow.

08:08.900 --> 08:10.180
You don't need to be like him.

08:11.860 --> 08:12.660
Whether Fu Jiu

08:13.540 --> 08:14.620
or Xie Yanlai,

08:16.020 --> 08:17.180
you're just what you are.

08:19.660 --> 08:20.540
What I am...

08:27.140 --> 08:28.100
I'm someone

08:29.180 --> 08:30.980
that no one expects anything from.

08:34.060 --> 08:35.220
Not even my parents.

08:36.340 --> 08:37.340
Your parents lied to you.

08:38.140 --> 08:39.540
But they actually loved you.

08:41.140 --> 08:42.100
My father hated me.

08:43.100 --> 08:44.060
My mother blamed me.

08:45.380 --> 08:46.660
Even my brother

08:49.020 --> 08:49.860
schemed against me.

08:50.900 --> 08:51.940
You still have me.

08:55.260 --> 08:56.540
Being betrayed by your own family

08:57.700 --> 08:58.980
must have broken your heart.

09:00.900 --> 09:02.700
But if you doubt the person before you because of that,

09:03.460 --> 09:05.180
you'll fall right into their traps.

09:08.300 --> 09:08.940
I'm sorry.

09:21.100 --> 09:22.580
We love and trust each other.

09:23.980 --> 09:26.580
And we'll grow old together.

09:56.020 --> 09:56.660
Your Lordship,

09:57.620 --> 09:59.300
the Grand Princess has left the city.

10:00.700 --> 10:01.860
This woman is better

10:02.420 --> 10:04.420
at striking a nerve than her father.

10:05.460 --> 10:06.620
His Highness is held captive

10:06.700 --> 10:07.580
in the side residence.

10:08.100 --> 10:08.980
[Ning Kun, Chief Clerk of the Prefecture]
But don't worry.

10:09.340 --> 10:10.220
We've sent men

10:10.540 --> 10:11.820
to take care of him in private.

10:12.060 --> 10:14.100
Does Xun blame me?

10:14.820 --> 10:15.660
He will understand

10:15.900 --> 10:17.660
that you had no choice.

10:20.700 --> 10:22.500
My son has always been sensible.

10:23.540 --> 10:25.620
He knows that a son relies on his father

10:25.740 --> 10:27.380
and a father schemes for his son.

10:29.700 --> 10:31.180
Why do you think

10:32.340 --> 10:33.380
Xie Yanlai is willing

10:33.420 --> 10:35.380
to be Chu Zhao's blade?

10:36.620 --> 10:38.100
Perhaps for fame and wealth.

10:39.460 --> 10:41.140
Or perhaps for...

10:42.340 --> 10:43.020
Beauty?

10:47.020 --> 10:48.740
The court is in a state of flux.

10:49.860 --> 10:51.940
Xun is trapped in the Capital.

10:52.540 --> 10:53.660
Xie Yanfang

10:54.420 --> 10:55.100
and Deng Yi

10:55.580 --> 10:56.780
have their own ambitions.

10:57.660 --> 10:59.300
And there is the Grand Princess,

10:59.340 --> 11:00.900
who lies in wait to strike.

11:01.900 --> 11:03.380
Now, it has become

11:03.380 --> 11:05.020
a complete stalemate.

11:05.900 --> 11:07.380
No matter what

11:07.780 --> 11:09.260
Xie Yanlai is after,

11:09.660 --> 11:10.900
I have a feeling

11:13.540 --> 11:14.700
that he will be the one

11:16.060 --> 11:17.180
to break the stalemate.

11:21.020 --> 11:21.900
What's on your mind?

11:23.660 --> 11:24.620
Father once said,

11:24.900 --> 11:25.820
beyond the battlefield,

11:26.660 --> 11:28.020
human hearts are the most complex.

11:28.780 --> 11:29.380
Scared?

11:31.060 --> 11:32.340
I just think it's absurd.

11:34.260 --> 11:35.340
Lord of Xiaonan wants fame.

11:35.940 --> 11:37.020
Xie Yanfang wants power.

11:37.420 --> 11:38.260
Deng Yi wants wealth.

11:39.020 --> 11:40.220
They never stop fighting.

11:40.620 --> 11:41.580
But no one has asked

11:41.860 --> 11:43.180
what our people want.

11:45.620 --> 11:46.580
People still have you.

11:49.140 --> 11:49.740
Zhao.

11:50.660 --> 11:51.660
This is good.

11:53.340 --> 11:54.380
In the court,

11:55.860 --> 11:56.940
you're still fighting.

11:57.620 --> 11:58.300
You care

11:58.860 --> 12:00.060
for our people.

12:03.340 --> 12:04.900
Actually, I'm not that selfless.

12:05.980 --> 12:06.740
Initially,

12:07.020 --> 12:08.580
I just wanted to stay alive.

12:09.620 --> 12:10.420
But my father

12:10.420 --> 12:12.060
died for our people.

12:13.020 --> 12:14.300
As his daughter,

12:14.740 --> 12:16.020
I should strive hard.

12:16.860 --> 12:18.180
I don't know how this will end.

12:18.660 --> 12:19.580
But I'll do my best.

12:24.060 --> 12:24.660
Jiu,

12:25.140 --> 12:26.060
tell me something

12:26.540 --> 12:28.020
about you and Xie Yanfang.

12:33.260 --> 12:34.620
Nothing special.

12:36.060 --> 12:37.660
When I was little, I wasn't accepted.

12:38.580 --> 12:39.380
In a fit of anger,

12:39.980 --> 12:41.460
I burned our ancestral hall.

12:42.180 --> 12:43.540
They would flog me to death.

12:44.700 --> 12:45.660
Xie Yanfang saved me.

12:46.660 --> 12:47.260
He told me

12:47.300 --> 12:48.420
I could stay by his side

12:49.060 --> 12:49.820
and one day,

12:51.380 --> 12:52.500
I would become a real member

12:52.500 --> 12:53.300
of that family.

12:54.380 --> 12:55.140
Back then,

12:56.820 --> 12:57.980
I was so eager

12:58.020 --> 12:59.100
to be recognized.

13:00.460 --> 13:01.460
So, when I was 16,

13:02.300 --> 13:03.700
he sent me to the Wei Village

13:04.860 --> 13:06.580
to sabotage the trade of Xiaonan caravan,

13:07.540 --> 13:08.060
I did that.

13:09.620 --> 13:10.780
You know what happened next.

13:11.700 --> 13:12.420
Is that why

13:13.580 --> 13:15.300
you were expelled from Xie Family?

13:19.860 --> 13:21.020
I kept heading into the desert

13:23.380 --> 13:24.620
until I met your father.

13:27.540 --> 13:28.980
What about

13:29.260 --> 13:30.340
the Bloodburn Pill?

13:32.260 --> 13:34.100
Xie Yanfang gave it to me

13:34.460 --> 13:35.300
before I left home.

13:36.580 --> 13:37.340
He told me

13:37.660 --> 13:38.580
the Bloodburn Pill

13:39.620 --> 13:40.780
was a secret elixir

13:40.860 --> 13:42.100
available to our direct line

13:42.740 --> 13:44.220
and could save my life in emergencies.

13:45.300 --> 13:46.660
I had absolute faith in him.

13:47.620 --> 13:48.420
I didn't doubt

13:48.420 --> 13:49.380
its function.

13:57.980 --> 13:59.460
Xie Yanfang won't be honest with me.

14:00.500 --> 14:01.660
I'll go to Gaoyang and investigate it.

14:02.340 --> 14:02.860
Now?

14:02.940 --> 14:03.420
Yes.

14:06.660 --> 14:07.460
You go back to the Capital.

14:08.220 --> 14:09.100
After I'm done,

14:09.620 --> 14:10.580
I'll be back for you.

14:19.300 --> 14:20.060
Wait for me.

14:31.620 --> 14:36.440
[Xie Family's old estate in Gaoyang]

14:39.180 --> 14:41.100
My Lord, the carriages are ready.

14:41.540 --> 14:42.660
We can return anytime.

14:43.020 --> 14:43.700
No hurry.

14:46.460 --> 14:47.820
The Grand Princess

14:48.300 --> 14:49.740
accomplished so much

14:51.140 --> 14:52.700
by winning without a battle.

14:53.540 --> 14:54.620
She isn't in a hurry to go back.

14:55.140 --> 14:56.060
Why should we be?

14:56.660 --> 14:57.860
Are you saying...?

14:58.460 --> 14:59.540
We'll go

15:00.420 --> 15:01.940
and say congratulations

15:03.580 --> 15:04.620
to Her Highness.

15:11.900 --> 15:12.860
Yanfang,

15:13.380 --> 15:14.740
why did you come to Xiaonan?

15:15.900 --> 15:18.180
To thank you for your peerless wisdom

15:19.620 --> 15:20.540
that saved our state

15:21.260 --> 15:22.260
from peril.

15:24.220 --> 15:25.940
You flatter me.

15:26.820 --> 15:29.260
It's actually you who saved our state

15:29.860 --> 15:31.780
by taking that urgent mission.

15:32.300 --> 15:33.500
You bravely urged His Majesty

15:33.540 --> 15:34.700
to command the army

15:35.460 --> 15:37.500
against the rebels

15:37.620 --> 15:39.100
even when defamed and denounced.

15:39.580 --> 15:41.260
That deserves the people's praise.

15:41.620 --> 15:43.420
With me leading His Majesty to war,

15:44.020 --> 15:45.220
you overawed the Lord of Xiaonan.

15:46.020 --> 15:47.180
I used you

15:47.820 --> 15:49.140
to cut off Xiao Xun's retreat.

15:49.940 --> 15:51.060
We took action far, far away.

15:51.540 --> 15:52.860
But all our steps interlocked.

15:53.300 --> 15:54.740
We cooperated perfectly.

15:55.300 --> 15:56.900
We can truly be called

15:57.820 --> 15:58.420
soulmates.

15:59.300 --> 16:00.380
I'm flattered.

16:01.060 --> 16:03.380
After all, your original plan

16:04.020 --> 16:05.620
was to sacrifice my clan

16:06.140 --> 16:07.340
for Xiao Xun's retreat.

16:07.980 --> 16:09.340
That's not right, Your Highness.

16:10.580 --> 16:11.660
Speaking of sacrifice,

16:12.460 --> 16:13.380
when you broke

16:13.420 --> 16:14.780
into Prince of Xiaonan's Residence,

16:15.300 --> 16:16.540
you left me no room

16:17.020 --> 16:18.660
to stop you.

16:19.580 --> 16:20.820
Isn't this just perfect?

16:22.140 --> 16:23.700
We took different actions.

16:24.060 --> 16:25.780
Yet things turned out perfectly.

16:26.300 --> 16:28.100
And I believe you've achieved

16:28.820 --> 16:30.100
what you desired most.

16:31.260 --> 16:31.860
How about

16:32.100 --> 16:33.700
I help you a bit more?

16:34.220 --> 16:35.940
I'll delay my return to the Capital.

16:36.300 --> 16:36.940
What do you say?

16:37.420 --> 16:38.820
I'll be happy

16:40.460 --> 16:41.620
if you're back in the Capital.

16:42.780 --> 16:45.020
After all, you're the one and only

16:45.340 --> 16:46.540
to play against me

16:47.300 --> 16:48.300
without losing ground.

16:48.860 --> 16:50.140
If you aren't in the Capital,

16:51.940 --> 16:53.180
won't that be boring?

16:54.180 --> 16:55.420
But anyway, you're right.

16:55.860 --> 16:57.420
I do owe you something.

16:58.380 --> 17:00.340
Yu has grown a bit closer to me.

17:00.700 --> 17:01.940
As his uncle,

17:02.940 --> 17:04.180
I feel quite relieved.

17:05.060 --> 17:06.500
I told you.

17:07.300 --> 17:08.300
Family bonds

17:08.340 --> 17:09.340
aren't so easy to sever.

17:10.220 --> 17:11.940
It's time you got closer.

17:12.540 --> 17:13.660
You've earned all this

17:13.700 --> 17:14.740
by doing good deeds.

17:15.300 --> 17:16.660
I don't deserve the credit.

17:17.860 --> 17:18.900
I wonder when you will

17:19.460 --> 17:21.020
return to the Capital.

17:22.020 --> 17:23.740
Xiao Xun devastated the people

17:23.780 --> 17:24.620
all along the way.

17:25.340 --> 17:26.820
And it is now the farming season.

17:27.460 --> 17:28.580
I'll make an inspection tour

17:28.580 --> 17:29.340
to reassure people

17:29.820 --> 17:31.180
on His Majesty's behalf.

17:34.380 --> 17:35.660
With you around,

17:36.780 --> 17:37.860
everything will be alright.

17:38.380 --> 17:40.220
And thank you for easing the people's burdens.

17:40.940 --> 17:42.020
Otherwise, at this moment,

17:42.340 --> 17:43.820
how could I be sitting here at ease?

17:45.260 --> 17:46.220
Even the redwood forest

17:46.260 --> 17:47.500
before my eyes

17:48.020 --> 17:49.740
would have been burned down in the war.

17:50.980 --> 17:52.100
So, I've been waiting here

17:52.620 --> 17:53.580
to make this toast

17:54.020 --> 17:55.020
with tea instead of wine

17:55.820 --> 17:57.180
for the sake of our people.

18:07.460 --> 18:08.460
The second toast

18:10.860 --> 18:12.300
is to offer my apology.

18:13.140 --> 18:14.420
I revealed your uncle's dealings

18:14.820 --> 18:16.060
with Xiao Xun

18:16.620 --> 18:18.580
because I didn't have a choice.

18:20.700 --> 18:21.460
I know.

18:22.100 --> 18:23.020
If the court

18:23.060 --> 18:24.140
hadn't hunted my uncle,

18:24.620 --> 18:25.420
they wouldn't have

18:25.460 --> 18:26.940
approached Xiao Xun so smoothly.

18:27.420 --> 18:28.100
What you did

18:28.980 --> 18:30.300
benefited both of us.

18:31.940 --> 18:32.900
You don't mind

18:33.820 --> 18:35.820
only because you're broad-minded.

18:38.420 --> 18:40.420
I wonder if you like mountain climbing.

18:41.540 --> 18:43.140
Have a try when possible.

18:44.380 --> 18:45.820
I believe you'll like it.

18:46.820 --> 18:48.700
When you stand on the summit

18:49.420 --> 18:51.180
and gaze upon everything,

18:52.500 --> 18:53.580
you will know the feeling

18:54.820 --> 18:56.860
of wandering freely across the land.

18:57.300 --> 18:58.660
So what you want

18:59.060 --> 19:00.740
is to reign over the masses

19:01.340 --> 19:03.380
and take everything under control?

19:03.740 --> 19:04.700
To be honest,

19:05.940 --> 19:06.980
when I knew Lord of Xiaonan

19:07.060 --> 19:08.420
rose up in rebellion,

19:08.780 --> 19:10.060
I was really delighted.

19:10.660 --> 19:12.420
I finally had an opportunity

19:13.780 --> 19:15.180
to make up for my regret.

19:16.060 --> 19:17.140
But sadly,

19:17.860 --> 19:19.420
I disrupted that.

19:20.780 --> 19:22.100
Should I

19:23.860 --> 19:24.860
make the third toast

19:25.620 --> 19:27.460
to apologize to you?

19:28.220 --> 19:29.500
For the state and the people,

19:30.940 --> 19:31.980
you did nothing wrong.

19:32.660 --> 19:34.540
You don't have to apologize to anyone.

19:36.260 --> 19:37.540
I'm quite relieved

19:37.660 --> 19:38.620
to hear you say that.

19:43.180 --> 19:44.540
But I'm quite curious.

19:45.460 --> 19:47.260
Why did you take that risk yourself?

19:48.300 --> 19:49.980
It's all right that you don't trust me.

19:51.100 --> 19:52.460
But you must trust my determination

19:52.460 --> 19:53.820
to kill Lord of Xiaonan for His Majesty.

19:54.540 --> 19:55.660
You would rather die

19:55.660 --> 19:56.780
with Lord of Xiaonan

19:57.540 --> 19:58.700
than discuss it with me.

19:59.100 --> 20:00.340
Do you find me

20:01.580 --> 20:03.500
even more terrifying?

20:08.300 --> 20:09.180
Yanfang,

20:10.420 --> 20:11.820
you were fighting for yourself

20:12.980 --> 20:14.300
while I was fighting for myself.

20:15.020 --> 20:15.900
I didn't want

20:15.900 --> 20:17.060
to disrupt your plan.

20:17.740 --> 20:18.580
Nor could I

20:19.180 --> 20:21.380
let you plan for me.

20:22.340 --> 20:23.100
Fine.

20:24.580 --> 20:25.740
You and I fight our own war.

20:26.580 --> 20:27.780
When we share the same goal,

20:28.940 --> 20:30.820
we're fighting side by side too.

20:34.380 --> 20:35.460
What about Xie Yanlai?

20:36.660 --> 20:37.460
Have you thought

20:37.820 --> 20:39.820
about fighting side by side with him?

20:43.380 --> 20:44.420
Your Highness,

20:46.540 --> 20:47.580
why do you ask?

20:49.100 --> 20:50.300
Nothing.

20:51.460 --> 20:52.620
I simply want to know

20:53.460 --> 20:54.660
what you think

20:55.020 --> 20:56.660
of your brother.

20:57.380 --> 20:58.500
Like you said,

20:59.300 --> 21:00.380
he's my brother.

21:01.300 --> 21:02.420
How could I do him harm?

21:02.980 --> 21:03.660
Besides, Yanlai

21:03.740 --> 21:05.220
grew up by my side.

21:05.820 --> 21:07.460
I know him better than anyone.

21:08.300 --> 21:09.940
Since he chose to follow you,

21:10.660 --> 21:12.060
he would never betray you.

21:13.460 --> 21:14.740
Did you ask that

21:15.860 --> 21:17.500
because you didn't fully trust him

21:19.820 --> 21:21.700
or because he was one of my family?

21:24.140 --> 21:25.380
Thank you for the tea.

21:26.140 --> 21:27.020
I must get going.

21:30.060 --> 21:31.220
Yu is waiting for you.

21:32.580 --> 21:33.660
Go back early.

21:36.020 --> 21:37.580
This time, you didn't kill

21:37.700 --> 21:38.460
Lord of Xiaonan

21:38.500 --> 21:39.820
with your own blade,

21:40.220 --> 21:41.140
but I believe

21:41.940 --> 21:43.300
you will find a way

21:43.340 --> 21:44.340
to cut off his allies

21:44.820 --> 21:45.940
and crush his sinews.

21:51.220 --> 21:52.900
Even if he were a mountain,

21:53.380 --> 21:54.220
you would be able

21:54.340 --> 21:56.020
to flatten him with your bare hands.

22:01.660 --> 22:02.500
That's right.

22:04.180 --> 22:05.020
I would.

22:08.020 --> 22:09.020
Wait a minute.

22:16.420 --> 22:17.460
[Grand Princess Token]
Take this back.

22:23.220 --> 22:24.340
Thank you

22:24.540 --> 22:25.460
for keeping it for me.

22:26.460 --> 22:28.060
Glad you trusted me.

22:29.540 --> 22:30.100
Du Qi,

22:30.980 --> 22:31.860
see Her Highness off.

22:32.500 --> 22:33.100
Yes.

22:53.740 --> 22:54.380
Mr. Xie,

22:54.940 --> 22:55.980
she is intentionally

22:55.980 --> 22:57.100
going against you.

22:58.060 --> 22:59.500
She's just being herself.

23:01.340 --> 23:02.860
She serves no one.

23:04.900 --> 23:05.580
Whatever happens,

23:06.020 --> 23:07.540
she naturally puts herself first.

23:08.500 --> 23:09.300
She isn't

23:09.340 --> 23:10.340
on our side.

23:12.300 --> 23:14.340
We aren't on her side either.

23:17.380 --> 23:18.060
She and I

23:18.100 --> 23:19.180
are just alike.

23:19.820 --> 23:21.060
She takes very few guards now.

23:21.900 --> 23:22.980
Shall we just...?

23:22.980 --> 23:23.700
Du Qi,

23:26.460 --> 23:28.420
Yu relies on Chu Zhao.

23:28.940 --> 23:30.500
She can be killed by anyone,

23:31.460 --> 23:33.820
anyone but my clan.

23:36.220 --> 23:36.740
I got it.

23:37.860 --> 23:38.660
Anyway,

23:42.220 --> 23:44.540
it's not about how hard it is.

23:47.700 --> 23:48.660
Then what is it about?

23:52.780 --> 23:54.220
I've finally met

23:54.220 --> 23:56.060
a true match.

24:00.220 --> 24:01.620
How could I bear to kill her?

24:03.980 --> 24:05.980
[Chu Mansion]

24:06.580 --> 24:07.100
Father.

24:07.460 --> 24:07.940
Mother.

24:08.180 --> 24:08.900
Zhao is here.

24:08.900 --> 24:09.780
Be right there. Hurry.

24:10.940 --> 24:11.620
Zhao.

24:12.260 --> 24:13.220
Oh, Zhao.

24:13.540 --> 24:14.340
- Zhao. - Zhao.

24:14.900 --> 24:16.460
Sorry, I was so foolish.

24:16.580 --> 24:18.220
I just was.

24:18.660 --> 24:20.340
Deceived by Xiao Xun,

24:20.380 --> 24:21.500
we nearly got you in trouble.

24:21.540 --> 24:22.180
That's right.

24:22.380 --> 24:23.580
What's gone is gone.

24:24.500 --> 24:25.420
When you're alive,

24:25.700 --> 24:26.780
my father would be relieved

24:26.940 --> 24:27.940
even in the underworld.

24:28.860 --> 24:29.660
That's right.

24:30.940 --> 24:31.940
Tang,

24:32.580 --> 24:34.380
I have a mission for you.

24:35.900 --> 24:36.740
Mission again?

24:37.500 --> 24:38.180
But I...

24:38.660 --> 24:40.020
Will it be another mission

24:40.100 --> 24:41.300
that may get me killed?

24:43.060 --> 24:44.460
I want you to hold

24:44.860 --> 24:46.060
a literary gathering for me.

24:48.220 --> 24:48.940
Now?

24:50.060 --> 24:52.020
But the Capital is in turmoil.

24:53.020 --> 24:55.780
All the clans are observing. What if...?

24:56.220 --> 24:57.100
That's why.

24:59.100 --> 25:00.260
Mr. Zhou loves cranes.

25:00.460 --> 25:01.660
The head of Qi Family loves swords.

25:02.060 --> 25:03.340
The Pei ladies excel at guqin.

25:03.980 --> 25:05.180
You know who to invite.

25:06.220 --> 25:06.580
But I...

25:06.660 --> 25:07.140
I...

25:07.540 --> 25:08.380
These people

25:08.900 --> 25:09.780
secure the state.

25:09.820 --> 25:11.860
We can't stabilize the court without their support.

25:14.060 --> 25:15.780
Jiu followed me to Prince of Xiaonan's Mansion.

25:16.340 --> 25:18.020
Lord of Xiaonan was wary of him

25:18.220 --> 25:20.020
simply because he came from the Xie Family.

25:20.900 --> 25:23.340
This century-old family is the pillar of our state.

25:23.580 --> 25:24.500
Xie Yanfang

25:24.780 --> 25:26.420
knows the Zhou Family helped you escape

25:26.540 --> 25:28.220
but doesn't dare to give them a hard time

25:28.540 --> 25:30.200
because they've been loyal

25:30.200 --> 25:30.820
with great prestige.

25:32.460 --> 25:34.380
Big clans are the foundation of court.

25:34.500 --> 25:35.380
To govern a state,

25:35.940 --> 25:37.700
the ministers must be united

25:37.780 --> 25:38.580
and help each other.

25:38.780 --> 25:40.180
Do you understand the meaning?

25:40.780 --> 25:41.420
Zhao,

25:42.140 --> 25:43.260
you've changed.

25:44.380 --> 25:45.020
No.

25:46.220 --> 25:47.060
I just

25:47.500 --> 25:48.380
have learned

25:48.420 --> 25:50.060
to play by their rules.

25:53.580 --> 25:54.260
By the way,

25:54.620 --> 25:55.620
what has the Grand Mentor

25:55.660 --> 25:56.820
been doing lately?

25:57.220 --> 25:58.100
Made a fortune again?

25:58.340 --> 25:59.420
Going over the accounts?

25:59.700 --> 26:00.500
Lord of Xiaonan...

26:01.300 --> 26:01.940
Oh no.

26:02.220 --> 26:03.380
Prince of State.

26:03.860 --> 26:05.700
He must have got a lot from His Lordship.

26:06.380 --> 26:07.180
Maybe

26:07.380 --> 26:08.740
he even

26:09.300 --> 26:10.140
got his position

26:10.300 --> 26:12.340
in the same way.

26:12.700 --> 26:13.860
In that case,

26:14.500 --> 26:15.700
His Lordship is still

26:16.660 --> 26:18.660
controlling the court.

26:20.020 --> 26:21.060
His Majesty is here.

26:21.420 --> 26:23.180
So is Young Master Xie Yanfang.

26:23.580 --> 26:24.260
Deng Yi

26:24.620 --> 26:26.140
won't seize all power for himself.

26:26.420 --> 26:28.220
Today, my daughter got up even earlier

26:28.260 --> 26:29.460
than I came to court.

26:29.900 --> 26:31.660
I didn't even see her at breakfast.

26:32.220 --> 26:34.100
I was told she went off to do something big.

26:34.500 --> 26:35.260
Recently,

26:35.340 --> 26:36.780
all the ladies have been busy.

26:36.820 --> 26:37.780
What's more,

26:38.140 --> 26:39.340
they've been spending a lot.

26:40.540 --> 26:42.080
Is the Grand Princess

26:42.080 --> 26:42.580
coming back?

26:43.780 --> 26:45.900
Her Highness is at the height of her fame.

26:46.420 --> 26:47.900
If she intends to return,

26:48.500 --> 26:49.660
we should

26:49.900 --> 26:51.260
prepare in advance to welcome her.

26:51.460 --> 26:52.300
Ladies in my family

26:52.340 --> 26:54.060
clamor to imitate Her Highness.

26:54.320 --> 26:55.740
They come out from the inner chambers.

26:59.020 --> 26:59.920
It's late.

26:59.920 --> 27:00.940
Why hasn't His Majesty come yet?

27:01.300 --> 27:02.820
His Majesty is slacking off for once.

27:03.560 --> 27:04.400
After the New Year,

27:04.620 --> 27:05.780
he's one year older.

27:06.500 --> 27:08.260
But he's less diligent.

27:09.520 --> 27:11.540
His Majesty isn't slacking off.

27:53.660 --> 27:55.420
Greetings, Your Majesty.

27:55.620 --> 27:57.580
Greetings, Your Highness.

28:00.580 --> 28:02.100
Rise, all of you.

28:02.820 --> 28:04.660
Thank you, Your Majesty.

28:06.020 --> 28:07.580
I was away for a long time.

28:07.940 --> 28:09.020
When I'm back here,

28:09.340 --> 28:10.380
I see all of you

28:10.420 --> 28:11.780
still work hard on state affairs.

28:12.620 --> 28:13.780
I'm quite relieved.

28:15.060 --> 28:16.340
Your Highness,

28:16.620 --> 28:18.480
you made great merit in pacifying

28:18.830 --> 28:19.960
the Northern Desert riot.

28:20.620 --> 28:21.260
We...

28:21.260 --> 28:22.300
You flatter me.

28:22.860 --> 28:23.940
It's the duty

28:24.140 --> 28:25.740
of our Chu Clan

28:25.780 --> 28:26.700
to protect the state.

28:27.780 --> 28:29.580
But when I was away,

28:30.500 --> 28:33.220
I heard a lot of criticism.

28:35.540 --> 28:36.220
Today,

28:36.860 --> 28:37.980
I'll make everything clear

28:38.100 --> 28:39.940
before all of you.

28:40.580 --> 28:41.780
I do everything

28:42.700 --> 28:44.260
just to assist His Majesty

28:45.180 --> 28:46.980
and keep our state secure for all ages.

28:47.900 --> 28:49.340
When the late Emperor entrusted me,

28:50.020 --> 28:51.100
he knew I wasn't someone

28:51.180 --> 28:52.460
to be locked in the inner palace.

28:53.020 --> 28:53.860
In the future,

28:54.460 --> 28:56.140
I never want to hear

28:56.420 --> 28:57.900
any gossip about me

28:57.980 --> 28:59.060
interfering with politics.

29:12.860 --> 29:13.940
At tomorrow's court,

29:14.700 --> 29:16.020
I want you to detail your methods

29:16.340 --> 29:18.660
of frontier farming and people's reassurance.

29:19.660 --> 29:20.420
Ministers,

29:20.540 --> 29:21.940
if you find it stifling indoors,

29:22.660 --> 29:23.780
why don't you

29:24.060 --> 29:25.580
move out of the hall?

29:26.260 --> 29:27.980
Having the court in the sunlight

29:28.700 --> 29:30.420
may make you feel more refreshed.

29:34.300 --> 29:35.060
After all,

29:36.100 --> 29:37.500
governing a state is like traveling.

29:39.380 --> 29:41.220
We have to see what lies ahead

29:41.900 --> 29:43.540
to avoid going off track.

30:15.380 --> 30:17.260
I came back too hastily.

30:17.980 --> 30:19.140
And the frontier is poor.

30:19.660 --> 30:20.860
I didn't prepare gifts

30:21.300 --> 30:22.140
for you, Mr. Deng.

30:22.940 --> 30:23.900
Please forgive my rudeness.

30:24.300 --> 30:25.340
Don't say that.

30:25.740 --> 30:27.500
Your Highness put down the Xiaonan rebellion

30:27.700 --> 30:29.100
and saved your uncle's family.

30:29.300 --> 30:30.940
You were really courageous.

30:31.860 --> 30:32.820
Seeing you

30:32.900 --> 30:34.340
sit here safe and sound,

30:34.700 --> 30:36.180
is the greatest gift to me.

30:37.700 --> 30:39.180
Thank you for your concern.

30:43.020 --> 30:44.740
After this journey,

30:45.140 --> 30:46.300
Your Highness has totally changed.

30:47.540 --> 30:49.020
What you said in the court today

30:50.940 --> 30:52.660
intimidated everyone.

30:57.780 --> 30:59.460
Anyway, I couldn't make it back

31:00.380 --> 31:01.900
without your help.

31:02.500 --> 31:03.420
I'll make this toast

31:04.460 --> 31:05.540
to express my thanks.

31:06.260 --> 31:08.100
Compared to Mr. Xie's tea,

31:08.580 --> 31:09.940
the tea I'm offering

31:11.380 --> 31:12.820
might be rather bland.

31:13.340 --> 31:14.540
I just hope

31:14.580 --> 31:15.700
you won't blame me

31:15.740 --> 31:16.980
for my risky move.

31:17.420 --> 31:18.900
That's what I think too.

31:20.180 --> 31:22.420
If you have any further plans,

31:23.100 --> 31:24.580
please tell me in advance.

31:24.860 --> 31:26.300
If you move so unexpectedly again,

31:26.580 --> 31:27.420
you and I might

31:27.460 --> 31:29.140
end up falling out.

31:29.380 --> 31:30.580
If I had informed you,

31:31.420 --> 31:33.260
would you approve?

31:35.860 --> 31:36.540
No.

31:37.300 --> 31:38.580
You would stop me.

31:39.460 --> 31:40.620
In that case,

31:41.500 --> 31:43.380
our mutual trust would also be harmed.

31:47.220 --> 31:48.420
You are right to rebuke me.

31:50.740 --> 31:52.180
I'm to blame for the discord

31:52.860 --> 31:54.180
between His Majesty and ministers.

31:55.740 --> 31:57.220
His Majesty is innocent.

31:58.300 --> 31:59.300
Lately,

31:59.820 --> 32:01.540
have you kept an eye on Xiaonan?

32:01.660 --> 32:03.300
Are you interested in Xiaonan

32:03.900 --> 32:05.100
or the Xie Family's soldiers

32:05.140 --> 32:06.500
around Xiaonan?

32:06.580 --> 32:07.940
Xiaonan is no longer a threat.

32:08.180 --> 32:09.060
When we focused

32:09.180 --> 32:11.780
on Xiaonan and the Northern Desert,

32:12.300 --> 32:13.580
we didn't see the Xie Family

32:13.740 --> 32:14.460
place many followers

32:14.460 --> 32:15.980
without being noticed.

32:16.580 --> 32:17.580
Mr. Deng,

32:17.980 --> 32:19.260
what do you think

32:19.980 --> 32:21.020
they're doing this for?

32:21.260 --> 32:22.380
You and I

32:22.820 --> 32:24.500
know it very well.

32:27.100 --> 32:28.100
If the game board

32:28.620 --> 32:29.660
becomes unbalanced,

32:30.340 --> 32:31.660
someone has to balance it.

32:32.060 --> 32:33.420
Are you saying

32:33.740 --> 32:34.820
you want me

32:35.500 --> 32:37.580
to balance it?

32:39.540 --> 32:41.340
The balance lies in equal power.

32:42.060 --> 32:43.380
The Xie Family is too powerful

32:43.580 --> 32:44.500
to be underestimated.

32:45.620 --> 32:46.260
Mr. Deng,

32:46.980 --> 32:48.540
you aim for a high position.

32:49.140 --> 32:49.980
Why?

32:50.220 --> 32:51.700
The same reason as yours.

32:52.260 --> 32:53.420
I want no one

32:54.900 --> 32:56.700
to stand in my way anymore.

32:58.060 --> 32:58.980
In that case,

32:59.900 --> 33:01.580
why do you bother with leadership?

33:02.460 --> 33:03.420
You and I

33:03.420 --> 33:04.660
are on the same path.

33:05.340 --> 33:06.060
We will also

33:06.860 --> 33:08.060
do the same thing.

33:08.820 --> 33:09.700
Then why don't we

33:10.540 --> 33:11.620
join forces?

33:17.320 --> 33:22.480
[Gaoyang County]

34:25.540 --> 34:26.340
You're here again.

34:26.900 --> 34:27.620
Yes.

34:28.260 --> 34:29.340
I came to congratulate you.

34:30.820 --> 34:31.620
On what?

34:32.740 --> 34:34.580
You said something to Chu Tang

34:35.100 --> 34:36.860
about the clans you would win over.

34:37.900 --> 34:39.580
It means you've realized

34:40.020 --> 34:41.620
what matters most.

34:42.860 --> 34:44.660
Now you should think carefully

34:45.180 --> 34:45.900
about what

34:46.500 --> 34:48.340
you should give up.

34:49.100 --> 34:49.980
Give up?

34:50.500 --> 34:51.940
Give up Xie Yanlai

34:52.380 --> 34:53.740
and choose Xie Yanfang.

34:54.300 --> 34:55.700
Then your path to power

34:55.740 --> 34:56.900
will be steadier

34:57.380 --> 34:58.460
and smoother.

35:02.580 --> 35:03.180
No.

35:03.700 --> 35:05.180
Why are you being foolish again?

35:05.700 --> 35:06.940
What's so good about Xie Yanlai?

35:07.500 --> 35:08.700
He has great martial arts,

35:09.020 --> 35:10.460
but can he fight off an army?

35:10.620 --> 35:11.780
Can he withstand

35:11.820 --> 35:13.020
the dispute in the court?

35:16.300 --> 35:17.020
Jiu

35:18.300 --> 35:19.100
is sincere with me.

35:19.340 --> 35:20.180
Sincere?

35:20.820 --> 35:21.660
In front of power,

35:21.780 --> 35:23.620
sincerity is the least valuable.

35:24.300 --> 35:25.660
Xie Yanfang is

35:25.740 --> 35:26.820
the true master of his clan.

35:27.580 --> 35:28.420
He's worth

35:29.140 --> 35:31.100
ten times more than Xie Yanlai.

35:32.140 --> 35:33.460
Don't you understand?

35:33.900 --> 35:35.020
To live well,

35:35.340 --> 35:36.740
you must be more ruthless

35:37.420 --> 35:38.620
and scheming than them.

35:39.740 --> 35:40.500
Xie Yanfang wants

35:40.540 --> 35:41.740
an ally, doesn't he?

35:42.260 --> 35:43.380
Then give him one.

35:44.740 --> 35:45.700
Let him think

35:46.460 --> 35:47.740
he can truly control you.

35:48.420 --> 35:49.260
Little does he know

35:50.060 --> 35:50.820
a hunter

35:51.580 --> 35:54.020
often appears in the guise of the prey.

35:55.900 --> 35:56.580
Zhao.

35:57.860 --> 35:58.540
Zhao.

35:59.380 --> 36:00.020
Zhao.

36:01.540 --> 36:02.700
Play on the swing with me.

36:23.700 --> 36:24.420
Zhao,

36:25.900 --> 36:26.780
what's wrong?

36:27.780 --> 36:28.500
Nothing.

36:29.380 --> 36:30.220
I'm just

36:31.980 --> 36:33.220
missing my mother.

36:35.220 --> 36:36.100
Actually,

36:36.660 --> 36:37.540
I also wish

36:37.620 --> 36:39.140
my parents could be alive.

36:40.060 --> 36:41.300
That would be enough.

36:42.020 --> 36:44.620
Even if Father still didn't play with me...

36:45.540 --> 36:48.700
Even if Mother still lectured me...

36:50.020 --> 36:51.300
But in this life,

36:52.180 --> 36:53.660
nothing can be perfect.

36:55.260 --> 36:56.460
Just like my mother.

36:57.900 --> 36:58.780
I didn't have

36:58.860 --> 36:59.900
a good talk with her.

37:01.860 --> 37:02.660
I got no chance

37:02.660 --> 37:03.740
to call her Mother.

37:05.020 --> 37:06.180
Then she died in the battle

37:07.060 --> 37:08.100
to save my life.

37:09.820 --> 37:10.740
I didn't even

37:13.860 --> 37:15.180
truly remember

37:15.220 --> 37:16.380
what she looked like.

37:17.580 --> 37:18.460
The same with me.

37:19.460 --> 37:20.540
As time goes by,

37:21.540 --> 37:22.820
my mother's face

37:23.580 --> 37:25.420
grows fainter in my dreams.

37:26.900 --> 37:28.180
According to Uncle Yanfang,

37:28.580 --> 37:30.300
it's because I'm growing up.

37:31.060 --> 37:33.220
But why does that make me

37:33.500 --> 37:35.380
forget my mother's face?

37:36.260 --> 37:37.660
I don't want to forget.

37:39.300 --> 37:40.340
To forget

37:42.580 --> 37:43.580
might be a protection

37:43.620 --> 37:45.020
from our mothers.

37:46.340 --> 37:47.100
But Uncle Yanfang

37:47.100 --> 37:48.300
came up with an idea for me.

37:48.740 --> 37:49.660
What was that?

37:50.220 --> 37:51.020
Uncle Yanfang

37:51.100 --> 37:52.700
told me stories about Mother.

37:53.340 --> 37:54.860
He also painted a portrait of her

37:55.060 --> 37:56.060
and hung it in my room.

37:56.620 --> 37:57.740
Then, I wouldn't forget her.

37:58.460 --> 37:59.100
But...

37:59.900 --> 38:00.780
But sadly,

38:01.540 --> 38:03.420
the wind blew it down a few days ago

38:04.060 --> 38:06.020
and it was stained.

38:13.540 --> 38:14.740
Actually, forgetting her face

38:14.740 --> 38:15.580
won't be a problem.

38:18.220 --> 38:19.340
As long as you remember

38:19.940 --> 38:21.380
the warmth of her embrace

38:23.300 --> 38:24.820
and the rhymes she hummed for you,

38:26.780 --> 38:28.460
she will always stay in your heart

38:29.420 --> 38:30.380
and never be forgotten.

38:32.780 --> 38:34.380
Uncle Yanfang said the same thing.

38:37.660 --> 38:38.780
Now, you seem

38:39.180 --> 38:40.780
to like Uncle Yanfang a lot.

38:41.820 --> 38:42.740
He's been nice to me.

38:43.580 --> 38:44.300
Last time,

38:44.460 --> 38:45.780
he took me to the war.

38:46.580 --> 38:48.060
He even tried the armor on me.

38:48.700 --> 38:50.140
I looked so cool.

39:01.220 --> 39:01.860
Zhao,

39:02.540 --> 39:03.260
from now on,

39:03.260 --> 39:04.340
I'm your family.

39:04.980 --> 39:06.340
The closest one.

39:06.780 --> 39:07.340
All right?

39:11.860 --> 39:12.460
Sure.

39:16.060 --> 39:16.820
But Yu,

39:17.500 --> 39:18.860
nothing in life is certain.

39:19.820 --> 39:21.460
You must grow up quickly.

39:22.180 --> 39:24.100
Become a mature man.

39:25.260 --> 39:25.980
In that case,

39:27.380 --> 39:28.500
even if one day,

39:28.780 --> 39:30.140
I'm not by your side,

39:32.020 --> 39:33.780
you can be your own support

39:35.100 --> 39:36.740
and the backbone of the people.

39:39.340 --> 39:40.020
I will.

39:40.700 --> 39:42.380
I will be as strong as you.

39:42.780 --> 39:44.380
I will be a good emperor.

40:30.180 --> 40:30.740
Open it.

40:31.100 --> 40:31.740
Young Master,

40:32.220 --> 40:34.620
how could you be so presumptuous?

40:35.020 --> 40:36.740
If the clan head knows,

40:37.020 --> 40:37.660
I'm afraid

40:38.140 --> 40:40.100
I'll lose my life.

40:40.700 --> 40:41.420
Do you want

40:41.500 --> 40:42.900
to lose your life

40:44.060 --> 40:45.420
when Xie Yanfang knows?

40:47.020 --> 40:47.900
Or do you want me

40:50.500 --> 40:51.580
to kill you right now?

41:39.340 --> 41:40.020
What

41:40.900 --> 41:41.900
are these elixirs for?

41:42.860 --> 41:43.700
Young Master,

41:44.140 --> 41:46.420
they're for preserving someone's life.

41:47.580 --> 41:48.340
Whose life?

41:49.020 --> 41:49.500
I...

41:49.820 --> 41:51.340
I don't know.

42:03.300 --> 42:05.260
I really don't know.

42:05.980 --> 42:07.300
All I know is

42:07.500 --> 42:08.980
since five years ago,

42:09.180 --> 42:10.900
the clan head has had them delivered

42:11.060 --> 42:12.900
every three months.

42:13.140 --> 42:15.460
Yet no one but Du Qi

42:15.780 --> 42:17.340
would know who actually

42:17.660 --> 42:19.740
needs these elixirs.

42:20.500 --> 42:21.660
Five years ago?

42:22.460 --> 42:23.060
Yes.

42:23.420 --> 42:24.660
That was when you...

42:25.780 --> 42:27.420
You were involved in the fire case

42:27.660 --> 42:29.700
of the Wei Village.

42:49.500 --> 42:50.260
Xiang.

42:54.220 --> 42:58.820
♪Broken walls and withered branches, trapped in the mire♪

42:59.100 --> 43:01.580
♪Yet still striving to reach for the sky♪

43:01.620 --> 43:05.660
♪My pride is torn down and my body is sacrificed♪

43:07.900 --> 43:10.020
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

43:10.100 --> 43:12.060
♪And roars in the blaze♪

43:12.140 --> 43:15.380
♪Burning the cold night until daybreak♪

43:15.540 --> 43:17.780
♪Fate imprisons me♪

43:17.940 --> 43:22.740
♪But I won't beg the abyss for mercy♪

43:22.740 --> 43:26.940
♪Even if hope is faint, I remain proud♪

43:26.940 --> 43:31.220
♪A mayfly will cross the ocean, however long it takes♪

43:31.220 --> 43:36.660
♪However it ends up, I'll go my own way♪

43:36.660 --> 43:38.620
♪With no fear of the distance♪

43:38.620 --> 43:42.340
♪Born from decay, fireflies still burn♪

43:42.340 --> 43:46.780
♪With sword in hand, I'll pierce the dawn♪

43:46.780 --> 43:52.140
♪Let these scars all over me become♪

43:52.140 --> 43:55.740
♪My new pride♪

44:10.460 --> 44:13.340
♪Peril is everywhere in the palace♪

44:13.340 --> 44:15.860
♪Yet I smile to nobody but you♪

44:15.860 --> 44:17.800
♪Amidst the chaos♪

44:17.840 --> 44:23.440
♪I'll always be with you♪

44:23.980 --> 44:26.100
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

44:26.180 --> 44:28.140
♪And roars in the blaze♪

44:28.220 --> 44:31.460
♪Burning the cold night until daybreak♪

44:31.620 --> 44:33.860
♪Fate imprisons me♪

44:34.020 --> 44:38.820
♪But I won't beg the abyss for mercy♪

44:38.820 --> 44:43.020
♪Even if hope is faint, I remain proud♪

44:43.020 --> 44:47.300
♪A mayfly will cross the ocean, however long it takes♪

44:47.300 --> 44:52.740
♪However it ends up, I'll go my own way♪

44:52.740 --> 44:54.700
♪With no fear of the distance♪

44:54.700 --> 44:58.420
♪Born from decay, fireflies still burn♪

44:58.420 --> 45:02.860
♪With sword in hand, I'll pierce the dawn♪

45:03.640 --> 45:08.220
♪Let these scars all over me become♪

45:08.560 --> 45:11.820
♪My new pride♪
